[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_05_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_05_0010","text":"……呼"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_05_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_05_0020","text":"……啊──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_05_0030","text":"（那家店……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_05_0040","text":"（之前雏菜酱说过的\n　塔罗饼店……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_05_0050","text":"（期间限定水果塔……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_05_0060","text":"（……那个，期间是──）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_05_0070","text":"（……到、到这周为止……？）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_05_0080","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_05_0090","text":"（商店街的活动也是……\n　这周末，对吧……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_05_0100","text":"（准备什么的，很忙……\n　但是……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_05_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_05_0110","text":"那等小糸有空的时候\n我们一起去吃吧～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_05_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_05_9999","text":"店员"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_05_0120","text":"那个—……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_05_0130","text":"耶……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_05_0140","text":"方便的话，请进店里看看哦？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_05_0150","text":"那、那个……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_05_0160","text":"我，我没事……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_05_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_05_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_05_0170","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_05_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_05_0180","text":"（……怎、怎么办……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_05_0190","text":"（但是……\n　工作……很重要……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_05_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_05_0200","text":"只能做自己能做的事……\n除此之外，也没别的办法了……"}]
